# Do not use the IDE browser

The built-in browser (`cursor-ide-browser`: `browser_navigate`, `browser_tabs`, `browser_lock`, `browser_snapshot`, `browser_click`, and the other tools in that namespace) often never returns. One stuck call has no timeout and blocks the rest of the turn. Do not call those tools.

Verify UI with Vitest, or with the Playwright MCP (`user-playwright`) when a real page is required. If neither can reach the screen, say what you could not verify. Do not fall back to the IDE browser.
